  bundled to power an offline typeahead while describing kill-chain steps.
  ATT&CK(R) and related content are (C) The MITRE Corporation and are used under
  the MITRE ATT&CK Terms of Use:
  https://attack.mitre.org/resources/legal-and-branding/terms-of-use/
