On-device machine-learning models (downloaded at runtime, not bundled)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Assisted extraction is optional. When enabled it downloads an embedding model on
first use directly from the Hugging Face Hub into your browser; no model is
distributed with Aurelian Lite. The built-in default models and their licenses:

  Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2   Apache-2.0  (port of
                            sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
  Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5  MIT         (port of BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5)

Each model remains subject to its own license and to the Hugging Face Hub terms.
Any additional model you add yourself is your responsibility.
